@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Process view · Processing work and return projection · 76282d3
skinparam defaultFontSize 21
skinparam ArrowFontSize 21
skinparam NoteFontSize 17
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam LegendFontSize 22
skinparam BackgroundColor #ffffff
hide footbox
database "processing_db" as pd $PROC
participant "Processing\nrelay" as relay $PROC
queue "ProcessingWorkQueue\nProcessingShortWorkQueue" as work $INFRA
participant "Encoder" as encoder $PROC
queue "MediaResults\nQueue" as results $INFRA
participant "MediaResults" as mr $MEDIA
database "media_db" as md $MEDIA

relay -> pd : 9  Reserve outbox
relay -> work : 10  await SendMessage(work)
alt short lane: ProcessingShortWorkQueue
  work ->> encoder : 11a  Lambda mapping invokes\nProcessingShortEncoder
else standard lane: ProcessingWorkQueue
' https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/worker/sqs.py#L309-L316
  encoder -> work : 11b  ReceiveMessage (long-poll)
  work --> encoder : 11c  work body
end
encoder -> pd : 12  Claim, then finish\n(separate state + result commits)
== Later Processing relay pass ==
relay -> pd : 13  Read result outbox
relay -> results : 14  await SendMessage(result)
results ->> mr : 15  SQS mapping
mr -> md : 16  Inbox + projection\nCOMMIT
legend bottom
  Relay = ProcessingCommands (post-commit) / ProcessingRepair (EventBridge: rate(1 minute)).
  Encoder = selected executor. ECS/S3 hint handlers also relay. Send replies omitted.
  Filled head = call; open head = async delivery; dashed = reply. Results stage in SQL before SQS.
  Blue = Media; amber = Processing; slate = SQS.
endlegend
@enduml
